abstract: >-
  Reference and constant-time native implementations of Windowed Hankel KEM, challenge
  instances of the Windowed Hankel LWE problem, and the scripts and recorded outputs behind
  every figure of the accompanying paper. Research code: the hardness of Windowed Hankel LWE
  is an assumption, and the KEM is not for production use.
